Third-party attributions
========================

FIGlet font
-----------

This project includes a bundled FIGlet font at:

  bubbletext/chunky.flf

The font file identifies itself as:

  Square by Chris Gill, 30-JUN-94 -- based on .sig of Jeb Hagan.

The generated binary font buffer at:

  bubbletext/chunky.bin

is derived from that FIGlet font and is rebuilt with:

  ./build bubbletext-font

raylib (downloaded for generated C projects)
------------------------------------------

otempl downloads a prebuilt raylib 6.2 release into generated C Raylib projects.
The Makefile links its static library. Raylib is not bundled in otempl.

  https://github.com/raysan5/raylib/releases/tag/6.2
  Copyright (c) 2013-2026 Ramon Santamaria (@raysan5)
  License: zlib

Preserve the downloaded release's license and bundled dependency notices.
The generated project README includes attribution and the upstream link.
